{"word":"ἀστεῖος","uri":"asteios","senses":[{"word":"ἀστεῖος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἀστεῖος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">α, ον,</span> de\ncitadin, <span class=\"ital\">p. suite</span> de bon goût, cultivé,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> élégant, agréable,\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de pers.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">452</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἄγροικος,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Phæd.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">116</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ;\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de choses,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ach.</span> <span class=\"refch\">811 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Gorg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">447</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ; <span class=\"grec\">ἀστεῖον ὅτι ἐρυθριᾷς,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Lys.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">204</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, c’est\nchose charmante de te voir rougir ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> fin, intelligent,\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de pers. et de choses,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Att.</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">avec une nuance\nd’ironie,</span> rusé, <span class=\"aut\">Diph.</span> <span class=\"ital\">et</span> <span class=\"aut\">Anaxil.</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">247</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ; <span class=\"refpa\">572</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>) ; <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de langage, de\nstyle,</span> fin, spirituel, <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Ran.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 901 ;</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Nub.</span> <span class=\"refch\">204 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\